# Benchmark artifacts (~397 MB) — hosted on Hugging Face dataset suanlab/PINNBench
# Run `make fetch-data` to populate locally; never commit to this repo.
# No trailing slash: on machines where this is a symlink to external storage,
# a `dir/` pattern would not match it.
experiments/results

# Timestamped stdout/stderr captures from long GPU runs
experiments/logs/

# Generated project page (deployed to the gh-pages branch, not kept on master)
docs/project_page/site/
